[Git Workflow Rules]
Always run `git branch --show-current` to verify the current branch before modifying files.
NEVER push, commit, or write code directly on the `main` branch.
All new work must be isolated in a dedicated feature branch.

[Operational Protocol]
1. Complete one user-requested task at a time.
2. After completing any coding task or meaningful milestone, trigger the Telegram notification script.
3. Use `npm run notify:telegram -- "<short summary>"`.
4. If the Telegram notification fails, report that failure in the final response.
